sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant WF as LangGraph Workflow
    participant MCP as GitHubMCPClient
    participant GH as GitHub MCP Server
    participant Norm as Normalizer
    participant Met as Metrics Engine
    participant Scr as Scoring Engine
    participant HF as Hugging Face LLM
    participant DB as DB Repository

    Client->>API: POST /api/v1/analyze
    API->>API: Validate AnalyzeRequest
    API->>WF: run_pipeline(owner, repo, employee)

    Note over WF: Node 1 fetch_github_data
    WF->>MCP: fetch_developer_activity
    MCP->>GH: spawn npx server-github
    MCP->>GH: session.initialize
    MCP->>GH: list_tools
    GH-->>MCP: available tools
    MCP->>GH: call_tool list_commits
    GH-->>MCP: commits list
    MCP->>MCP: Client-side filter by author
    MCP->>GH: call_tool list_pull_requests
    GH-->>MCP: pull_requests list
    loop For each PR
        MCP->>GH: call_tool get_pull_request_reviews
        GH-->>MCP: reviews list
    end
    MCP-->>WF: raw data dict

    Note over WF: Node 2 normalize_data
    WF->>Norm: normalize raw_data
    Norm->>Norm: DataNormalizer.normalize_batch
    Norm-->>WF: GenericActivity list

    Note over WF: Node 3 extract_metrics
    WF->>Met: extract_metrics
    Met-->>WF: MetricsResult

    Note over WF: Node 4 calculate_score
    WF->>Scr: calculate_score
    Scr-->>WF: score and grade

    Note over WF: Node 5 generate_ai_report
    WF->>HF: generate_report
    HF-->>WF: AIReport object

    Note over WF: Node 6 persist_to_db
    WF->>DB: save_employee + save_score + save_report
    DB-->>WF: logged

    WF-->>API: DevPulseState final
    API-->>Client: 200 OK response
